        <mxCell id="boundary" value="At any check: show missing information, approval, an unknown result or an unsupported choice, and who must act.&#10;Keep successful results and existing B2G (S07). Resume only affected checks; check the original request if its result is unknown.&#10;Phase 1: public-access checks. Later phase: private connections and routing changes. Private A to Private B stays disabled." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
